### PREREQS: you must download mogli:

https://github.com/sciapp/mogli

### STEP 1: Extract the last frames of the trajectory

- Use `traj_extract_last_frame.py` in the cluster/ACES to get the last frames of the trajectory file

- Download the directory containing the trajectory last frames.

### STEP 2: Take screenshots using script and analyzise

- Use `mogli_export_screenshots.py` to generate screenshots of all the last frames using mogli
